From 8cdf456f04f6032f665821391b2434bc42dc396f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: z060142 <z060142@yahoo.com.tw>
Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 09:01:41 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 273/307] !B (Terrain Plate) Generate plate geometry at world
 scale.

Generate the plate mesh at its final world dimensions and compensate the slot
transform, avoiding the incorrect shading frame produced by non-uniform object
scale. Transform changes still drive regeneration from authoritative scale.
---
 .../Geometry/TerrainPlateComponent.cpp        | 240 +++++++++++++-----
 .../Geometry/TerrainPlateComponent.h          |  33 ++-
 2 files changed, 200 insertions(+), 73 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Code/CryPlugins/CryDefaultEntities/Module/DefaultComponents/Geometry/TerrainPlateComponent.cpp b/Code/CryPlugins/CryDefaultEntities/Module/DefaultComponents/Geometry/TerrainPlateComponent.cpp
index fd28d455..763ca214 100644
